{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1a12b19b-0255-8fdf-9d37-f091c670ab0d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:05:37-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:04:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:04:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Um, yes. [pause] I'm trying to find out about a fence. I'm at 209 Gidley Street, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:04:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What are you looking to put up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:04:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I want to close in the side yard. There's a toddler in the house and, well, [pause] the yard is open right now. Chain-link, I think. Whatever is allowed tall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:04:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Do you own the property or are you renting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:04:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Renting. So, does a fence need a permit? That's what I really can't work out. And if it does, does the contractor take care of that, or the owner does?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:04:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally a fence does need a permit, yes. Usually the contractor can pull it, but since you rent, the owner has to sign off on the work. So you'd want your landlord involved first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:04:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Okay. I thought maybe it was on me. [pause] Sorry, I'm folding this map the old fashioned way, it keeps springing back open. How close to the property line can it go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:05:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That depends on the zone and on the fence height, so I don't want to give you a number off the top of my head. Someone here can look at your lot and tell you the setback. Can I take your callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:05:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0190."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:05:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one nine zero, got it. I'll have someone from zoning call you. In the meantime, talk to the owner about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:05:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the owner, then the contractor... I think I follow. Thank you."
    }
  ],
